<title>USA: U S West Communications Q2 meets estimates.</title>
<headline>U S West Communications Q2 meets estimates.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Calif. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U S West Communications Group on Friday reported second quarter earnings that were largely in line with Wall Street expectations, the result primarily of aggressive cost-cutting measures that offset flat operating revenues.</p>
<p>The Baby Bell operator's reported earnings per share of $0.65 matched exactly the First Call consensus estimate and grew 6.6 percent over the 1996 result of $0.61 per share.</p>
</text>
